<!-- Mystery Rank Modal -->
<style>
  /* Site menu rows, each destination gets its own coloured icon tile so the
     menu is scannable by shape+colour, with a text label always present. */
  .cf-menu-link { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.85rem; padding: 0.7rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem; color: #44403c; text-decoration: none; transition: background-color 0.15s; }
  .cf-menu-link:hover { background: #faf7f2; }
  .cf-menu-link:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #7a4e31; outline-offset: 2px; }
  .cf-menu-link[aria-current="page"] { background: #f6ece2; }
  .cf-menu-ico { flex-shrink: 0; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 0.7rem;
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .cf-menu-ico svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }
  /* Discord is a solid brand mark, the rest are Material outlines. Shrink it so its visual weight matches. */
  .cf-menu-ico-brand svg { width: 19px; height: 19px; }
  .cf-menu-text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; }
  .cf-menu-title { font-weight: 600; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.3; color: #292524; }
  .cf-menu-sub { font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.35; color: #6b6560; margin-top: 0.1rem; }
  .cf-menu-ext { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #8a8178; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .cf-menu-link { transition: none; } }
</style>

<dialog id="my_modal_rank" class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="mystery-rank-title" aria-describedby="mystery-rank-desc">
  <div class="modal-box w-11/12 max-w-4xl max-h-screen overflow-y-auto bg-white shadow-2xl">
    <form method="dialog">
      <button
        class="btn btn-sm btn-circle btn-ghost absolute right-3 top-3 z-10 hover:bg-gray-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-espresso transition-all duration-150"
        aria-label="Close Mystery Rank information"
      >
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 text-gray-500">
          <path d="m256-200-56-56 224-224-224-224 56-56 224 224 224-224 56 56-224 224 224 224-56 56-224-224-224 224Z"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </form>

    <div class="py-8 px-4 pr-14">
      <div class="mb-10">
        <h2 id="mystery-rank-title" class="text-3xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">
          About Mystery Rank
        </h2>
        <p id="mystery-rank-desc" class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Contribute to earn a spot in different categories. The more you give, the higher your rank. But here's the catch, no one knows how much anyone else has paid. It's this mystery that makes the competition exciting.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 mb-8">

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-8">Terms and Refunds</h3>

      <div class="space-y-5">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6 border border-gray-200">
          <h4 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900">One-Time Contribution</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            When you contribute to Mystery Rank, it's a one-time payment that secures your spot in the credits. Once the payment is made, it's final, there are no refunds or changes. We keep the process fair and transparent for everyone involved.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6 border border-gray-200">
          <h4 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900">How Your Rank is Determined</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Your rank within your chosen category is based on how much you contribute. The more you contribute, the higher your rank. However, the amounts remain private, adding mystery and excitement to the competition.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6 border border-gray-200">
          <h4 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900">When Your Credit Appears</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            After your payment is confirmed, your credit will be posted within 12 hours. We work hard to ensure everyone's contributions are recognized promptly. If there's a delay, we'll keep you informed.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6 border border-gray-200">
          <h4 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900">Handling Chargebacks</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            If a chargeback occurs, your credit will be immediately removed and you'll be blocked from future participation. We do this to protect the integrity of the rankings and ensure fairness for all contributors.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6 border border-gray-200">
          <h4 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900">Updating Your Listing or Link</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            If you need to update your listing or link after it's been posted, send us an email at
            <a
              href="mailto:hello@coffeeandfun.com?subject=Inquiry%20about%20Mystery%20Rank%20Credits&body=Hi%20there,%0D%0A%0D%0AI%20have%20a%20question%20about%20Mystery%20Rank%20Credits.%0D%0A%0D%0AThank%20you!"
              class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 font-medium underline"
            >
              hello@coffeeandfun.com
            </a>
            . We're happy to make one-time updates to ensure your information is correct.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6 border border-gray-200">
          <h4 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900">Need Help or Have Questions?</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            If you have any questions about the process, or if something isn't clear, please reach out. We're here to help and want to make sure your experience with Mystery Rank is smooth and enjoyable.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</dialog>

